  <FontFamily x:Key="Cora.Font.Heading">avares://Hymnal/Assets/Fonts#IBM Plex Mono, avares://Hymnal/Assets/Fonts#JetBrains Mono, avares://Hymnal/Assets/Fonts#Inter, monospace</FontFamily>
